Adaptation: Go implementation of schema-guided integer coercion for string
arguments after native tool-call parsing. Only explicit integer properties
are converted. Exact bounded rational arithmetic replaces upstream float
conversion to preserve large integer precision and bound exponent expansion.
Other schema types and nonintegral or invalid values remain unchanged.
